	this weekend. \nLake Plaza at Hermann Park (6100 Hermann Park Drive\, Hous
	ton\, TX 77030) \nFriday\, August 28: 12 – 8 p.m.\nSaturday\, August 29: 1
	2 – 8 p.m. \nSpecial Appearances: \nFriday\, August 28 \n\nBrian Cushing (
	3 – 4:30 p.m.)\nTexans Mariachi + Houston Texans Cheerleaders (5 – 6 p.m.)
	\n\nSaturday\, August 29 \n\nDeep Steel Thunder Drumline (2 – 3 p.m.)\nTor
	o + Houston Texans Cheerleaders (5 – 6 p.m.)\n\n\nLearn more at https://ww
	w.thirstysfanhq.com/texans-houston-tx.\n\nhttps://hermannpark.org/event/th
	irstys-fan-hq-pop-up-by-coca-cola/\n\nFrom Hermann Park Conservancy
